  "prefLabel": "He-P 3301.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 3301.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to eligible recipients seeking to obtain, and those farmers seeking to distribute, locally grown fresh fruits, vegetables, and cut herbs at designated New Hampshire farmers’ markets.\n\nSource. #14200, eff 2-26-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p3300.html"
